 {#triDA praRIto jvalanaH#} <ls>Hariv.</ls>
.²5 To inflict (as punishment); {#yadi na praRayed rAjA daRqaM daRqyezvatandritaH#}
 <ls>Ms. 7. 20</ls>, <ls n="Ms.">8. 238</ls>; <ls>Mb. 1. 64. 15</ls>.
