 {#manunA praRItaH#} <ls>R. 14. 67</ls>; {#BavatpraRItamAcAramAmananti hi sADavaH#} <ls>Ku. 6. 31</ls>.
.²7 To write, compose (as a work); {#praRItaH na tu prakASitaH#} <ls>U. 4</ls>;
 {#uttaraM rAmacaritaM tatpraRItaM prayujyate#} <ls>U. 1. 3</ls>.
.²8 To accomplish, effect, perform, bring about; {#praRIya dAridryadaridratAM#}
 {#nfpaH#} <ls>N. 1. 15</ls>, <ls n="N. 1.">19</ls>; {#kaRWASlezopagUQaM tadapi ca na ciraM yat priyABiH#}
 {#praRItam#} <ls>Bh. 3. 82</ls>.
.²9 To lead or reduce to any condition.
